  nonce: 040d  # 040d
  message: "Slice 3 landed in PR #3209 (merged to dev as f572cd27b). stop_logic.sh now sources .agent/hooks/_shared/awaits_bakeoff_nudge.py, which emits an '## AWAITS_BAKEOFF_VALIDATION BACKLOG' section into the guidance file when (a) ≥threshold tag-bearing items are in a blocking status AND (b) the most recent deep-*/state.json is older than stale_cycle_hours. Defaults threshold=5/stale_cycle_hours=72 live under stop_hook.awaits_bakeoff_validation_nudge in config.yaml.template; strict-greater-than on the stale gate so hour 73 is the first stale tick. AGENTS.md §Bakeoff Validation Discipline updated to document the mechanism. 25 unit + integration tests (tests/test_awaits_bakeoff_nudge.py) cover compute_nudge, config loading, find_latest_deep_cycle_mtime, count_tagged_items, end-to-end CLI, plus guards that stop_logic.sh invokes the worker and AGENTS.md documents it.\n\nRemaining slices: slice 2 (bakeoff-deep-reflect aggregate cross-ref — shell out to tracker --json list --tag awaits_bakeoff_validation at aggregation time and inject per-claim moved/no_move/inconclusive questions into the reflect prompt schema, auto-strip or spawn regression sub-item on response); slice 4 (acceptance demo — full cycle where a new PR with a quantitative claim gets tagged, survives a DEEP cycle, and loses the tag or spawns a regression)."  # 040d
